			"seed": 107,
			"version": 57,
			"versionNonce": 731702104,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1784522413789,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• A full workspace we work INSIDE, not just\n  a report we read\n\n• Click tasks, self-assign, add notes per goal\n  right where the work happens\n\n• Outreach + Marketing playbooks live next\n  to the tasks that use them (templates,\n  tactics, tools all in one place)\n\n• Visual progress we can browse anytime:\n  monthly heatmap, weekly contribution bars\n\n• Forces us to build real systems (RSS,\n  hosting, automation), great for deep\n  planning & research-backed decisions",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"baseline": 18,
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "• A full workspace we work INSIDE, not just\n  a report we read\n\n• Click tasks, self-assign, add notes per goal\n  right where the work happens\n\n• Outreach + Marketing playbooks live next\n  to the tasks that use them (templates,\n  tactics, tools all in one place)\n\n• Visual progress we can browse anytime:\n  monthly heatmap, weekly contribution bars\n\n• Forces us to build real systems (RSS,\n  hosting, automation), great for deep\n  planning & research-backed decisions",
			"lineHeight": 1.4,
			"autoResize": false,
			"index": "a6",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "• A full workspace we work INSIDE, not just\n  a report we read\n\n• Click tasks, self-assign, add notes per goal\n  right where the work happens\n\n• Outreach + Marketing playbooks live next\n  to the tasks that use them (templates,\n  tactics, tools all in one place)\n\n• Visual progress we can browse anytime:\n  monthly heatmap, weekly contribution bars\n\n• Forces us to build real systems (RSS,\n  hosting, automation), great for deep\n  planning & research-backed decisions"
		},
