		{
			"id": "Cfa02G5q",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 699.7964575411568,
			"y": 219.62542173582722,
			"width": 235.2485809326172,
			"height": 301.61580798257575,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 109,
			"version": 465,
			"versionNonce": 1590787672,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1784522452305,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new\n  to open, remember, or maintain\n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already\n  work (Obsidian), read where we already\n  talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no\n  browser setup, no cron jobs, nothing\n  that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically:\n  pace vs goals, who's carrying the week,\n  what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything\n  we could build — pure signal, no upkeep",
			"fontSize": 12.672933108511586,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"baseline": 18,
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new\n  to open, remember, or maintain\n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already\n  work (Obsidian), read where we already\n  talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no\n  browser setup, no cron jobs, nothing\n  that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically:\n  pace vs goals, who's carrying the week,\n  what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything\n  we could build — pure signal, no upkeep",
			"lineHeight": 1.4,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "a8",
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "• A report that comes TO us, nothing new\n  to open, remember, or maintain\n\n• Zero new tools: write where we already\n  work (Obsidian), read where we already\n  talk (Slack)\n\n• Least friction, easiest to start, no\n  browser setup, no cron jobs, nothing\n  that can silently break\n\n• Daily insight delivered automatically:\n  pace vs goals, who's carrying the week,\n  what's stalled, top task each person\n\n• Lowest admin overhead of anything\n  we could build — pure signal, no upkeep"
		},
